<!--
Tauri merges this dictionary into the generated macOS Info.plist. Its file association
schema does not expose CFBundleTypeIconFile, so keep each extension family, role, and
rank in sync with bundle.fileAssociations in tauri.conf.json. These are existing
archive formats, not new ZipLens-owned UTIs. Icons are copied to Resources via
bundle.resources; they do not replace the application icon or change user defaults.
